          { "title": "Presenting concern", "text": { "status": "generated", "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Acute worsening of treatment-resistant depression; PHQ-9 16. Presents for urgent telehealth check-in reporting new suicidal thoughts this week.</div>" } },
          { "title": "Risk assessment", "text": { "status": "generated", "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">C-SSRS: active ideation, passing thoughts of method (pills), no plan, no intent, no preparatory behavior. Means: no firearms; will remove/secure medication stockpile with sister. Protective factors: sister, pet, stated wish for relief rather than death. Clinical judgment: manageable as outpatient with safety plan; emergency department not indicated at this time.</div>" } },
