          { "title": "Disposition and plan", "text": { "status": "generated", "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Continue venlafaxine XR 225 mg and quetiapine 50 mg at bedtime tonight. Increased monitoring. In-person reassessment within 48 hours to discuss next-step options for treatment-resistant depression.</div>" } }
